  "notes": "<!-- dsh-notes:zh -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.4\n\n## 新增\n\n- 新增双语文档中心与自动化导航校验。\n- 改进静态站点导航、404 页面、站点地图、robots 和 canonical 元数据。\n\n## 修复与打磨\n\n- 修复手动检查更新失败后旧版本结果仍显示的问题。\n- 将应用、Tauri、Rust 和 SDK 版本元数据统一为 0.9.4。\n\n## 验证\n\n- 公共合同验证通过。\n- 打包测试 51/51 通过。\n- 生产构建和包体预算检查通过。\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:en -->\n# DSH Studio v0.9.4\n\n## Added\n\n- Added a bilingual documentation hub and automated navigation checks.\n- Improved static-site navigation, 404 handling, sitemap, robots, and canonical metadata.\n\n## Fixed and polished\n\n- Fixed stale release results remaining visible after a failed manual update check.\n- Aligned application, Tauri, Rust, and SDK version metadata to 0.9.4.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Public contract verification passed.\n- Packaging tests passed: 51/51.\n- Production build and bundle budget checks passed.\n\n<!-- dsh-notes:end -->",
